Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 06:21:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Test of the batch rotations of finite strain behaviours

An orthotropic finite strain behaviour is added to the test libraries:
GenericParallelIntegrateTest compares the batch rotations of the
thermodynamic forces and of the tangent operator blocks, for a given stress
measure and a given tangent operator, with the ones of the generic
interface.
---
 tests/CMakeLists.txt                          |  2 +
 tests/GenericParallelIntegrateTest.cxx        | 49 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../OrthotropicFiniteStrainElasticity.mfront  | 26 ++++++++++
 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tests/OrthotropicFiniteStrainElasticity.mfront

diff --git a/tests/CMakeLists.txt b/tests/CMakeLists.txt
index 006f214..98eb9a8 100644
--- a/tests/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tests/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -121,6 +121,7 @@ if(MGIS_HAVE_MFRONT_SUPPORT)
     BehaviourTest
     Elasticity
     OrthotropicElasticity
